asons why the metrics aren\'t being reported. That\'s the next step to dig deeper into the user-service\'s status.\n</think>\n\n', additional_kwargs={'tool_calls': [{'function': {'arguments': '{"command": "kubectl describe pod user-service -n social-network"}', 'name': 'exec_read_only_kubectl_cmd'}, 'id': 'chatcmpl-tool-8843ad77c8bdab98', 'type': 'function'}], 'provider_specific_fields': {'refusal': None, 'reasoning': None}}, response_metadata={'token_usage': {'completion_tokens': 452, 'prompt_tokens': 3458, 'total_tokens': 3910, 'completion_tokens_details': None, 'prompt_tokens_details': None}, 'model': 'openai/Qwen/Qwen3-8B', 'finish_reason': 'tool_calls', 'logprobs': None, 'model_name': 'openai/Qwen/Qwen3-8B'}, id='lc_run--019cfc9c-91cd-7610-9eab-d27ed8f267b5-0', tool_calls=[{'name': 'exec_read_only_kubectl_cmd', 'args': {'command': 'kubectl describe pod user-service -n social-network'}, 'id': 'chatcmpl-tool-8843ad77c8bdab98', 'type': 'tool_call'}], invalid_tool_calls=[], usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 3458, 'output_tokens': 452, 'total_tokens': 3910}), ToolMessage(content='Name:             user-service-559b79c875-8z6b4\nNamespace:        social-network\nPriority:         0\nService Account:  default\nNode:             node2.htliang2-agent.insai-pg0.apt.emulab.net/128.110.96.35\nStart Time:       Tue, 17 Mar 2026 16:22:02 +0000\nLabels:           app=user-service\n                  pod-template-hash=559b79c875\n                  service=user-service\nAnnotations:      <none>\nStatus:           Running\nIP:               10.244.2.252\nIPs:\n  IP:           10.244.2.252\nControlled By:  ReplicaSet/user-service-559b79c875\nContainers:\n  user-service:\n    Container ID:  docker://4b1ab20aec15f33194c25783e8172aa1ca5aa092c86de5ed7507c07dae469f32\n    Image:         docker.io/deathstarbench/social-network-microservices:latest\n    Image ID:      docker-pullable://deathstarbench/social-network-microservices@sha256:a845266e98ce15d204ee7b98d41a2a95820af525013ce70f14104f